<https://hexplain.io/ns/archive#EntryShape> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://hexplain.io/ns/archive> .
<https://hexplain.io/ns/archive#compressedSize> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The number of bytes occupied by an archive entry's compressed representation, distinct from its logical uncompressed size."@en .
